#: ../../../recipes.rst:4
msgid ""
"A collection of standalone, copy-paste solutions to specific problems. Each "
"recipe focuses on a single problem and provides a minimal solution which can "
"be adapted to real-world code. The examples are intentionally short and "
"avoid unnecessary abstractions so that the underlying psutil APIs are easy "
"to understand. Most of them are not meant to be used in production."
